{{ img:units/Reactor Core.png|Reactor Core}}
=Reactor Core=
*  Health: 24
*  Price: %Minerals% 120
*  [[concepts/sensory|Scanning range]]: 2
*  Consumes: %Uranium%5
*  Produces: %Energy%40
Amplifies the energy output of connected [[units/structures/generator]]s. Only one reactor core can be connected to any one [[units/structures/generator]], but multiple [[units/structures/generator]]s may be connected to the same reactor core. Must be placed on the same height level as the [[units/structures/generator]](s) to connect to.
